WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:05.189
Make the editor comfortable

2
00:00:05.698 --> 00:00:12.809
Make the page comfortable to write on. This only changes your screen, not the book.

3
00:00:12.811 --> 00:00:18.793
Pick a typeface and size you like reading.

4
00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:24.218
Spaced or indented paragraphs, line height and justified text are here too.

5
00:00:24.222 --> 00:00:28.975
Reset brings back the defaults any time.

6
00:00:28.978 --> 00:00:33.184
The eye icon above the page hides everything but your words.
